--[[
    PUMPKIN AUTO-COLLECTOR — Minimal Toggle UI (v6 noclip + infinite retry)
    ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Same 220×62 widget. Single switch.

    NEW:
      • Noclip during teleport — CanCollide=false on character parts
        while moving to and firing the pumpkin, restored right after
      • Accurate teleport — 12 offsets starting AT the pumpkin center,
        only drifting outward on retries
      • Infinite retry — each scanned pumpkin keeps retrying until
        the prompt/click actually disappears (collected) or the
        instance leaves the workspace (removed externally)
      • Post-collect ground snap — after collecting, teleports to
        ground below pumpkin, or back to original position if no
        ground (protects against floating pumpkins)

    ⚠ Teleport + noclip will trip most anti-cheats. If the game kicks
      you, turn auto OFF. This is a client-side bot.
]]

